<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Brazil power firm estimates changed.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Brazil power firm estimates changed.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns said in a report it had revised earnings per share (EPS) estimates for Brazilian state-owned power utilities CPFL, Eletropaulo, Cesp, Cemig and Eletrobras.</p>
<p>-- It also downgraded its rating for Sao Paulo state power firm CPFL to attractive from buy.</p>
</text>
